      "name": "Bloodfire Rose",
      "desc": "Claret has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>Bloodstained Chronicle</color>.\nBloodstained Chronicle: When Claret's attacks hit enemies and trigger Laceration, Gash Buildup Rate increases by 20%. The DMG Multiplier of Maim triggered by Claret increases to 130% of its original value.",
